    "innovation": "This paper presents multi-dataset observational evidence for an intensified Walker circulation from 1979-2008, attributing this trend to decadal variations in El Ni\u00f1o patterns and demonstrating a significant discrepancy with the results from general circulation models which largely fail to reproduce this strengthening.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
