            "target_entity_instance": "tropical Pacific Ocean",
            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "These variations, recognized from different data sets, occur in tandem with each other, strongly supporting the intensified Walker circulation over the tropical Pacific Ocean. Since the SST trend was attributed to more frequent occurrences of central Pacific-type El Ni\u00f1o in recent decades, it is suggested that the decadal variation of El Ni\u00f1o caused the intensified Walker circulation over the past 30 years.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
