            "paragraph": "Since the SST trend was attributed to more frequent occurrences of central Pacific-type El Ni\u00f1o in recent decades, it is suggested that the decadal variation of El Ni\u00f1o caused the intensified Walker circulation over the past 30 years.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
