            "target_entity_type": "Variable",
            "paragraph": "In particular, microwave-based Special Sensor Microwave Imager (SSM/I) measurements of the water budget parameters indicated that the Walker circulation has intensified over the 18-year observation period from 1988 to 2005 (Sohn and Park 2010).",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
